      "source": "Specifically, <code>@WebSocketScope</code> is a <em>composed annotation</em> that\nacts as a shortcut for <code>@Scope(\"websocket\")</code> with the default\n<a href=\"#proxyMode()\"><code>proxyMode()</code></a> set to <a href=\"../../../../context/annotation/ScopedProxyMode.html#TARGET_CLASS\"><code>TARGET_CLASS</code></a>.",
